# Pacing diagnostic (docs/re-battle-pacing.md): party of three (party3_strong) in the first temple battle.
# Jian attacks, Lucia casts Heal on Jian, Gabryel attacks; screenshots every frame of Lucia's action. Logs the round state, actor, the effect
# script timer (0x0213F148 +0xA2), battler 12's step and every battle main call (lag frames show as gaps).
include party3_strong
include warp6
wait 270
watch u32 0x020B0010 main_state
watch u16 0x020B85C8 substate
watch u16 0x0228296E round_state
watch u16 0x02282972 actor
watch u16 0x0228FC7C b12_step
watch u16 0x0213F1EA fx_timer
exec 0x020297D4 bmain
watch u16 0x02282A0E w_ce
watch u16 0x0213F1E8 fx_step
watch u32 0x0213F148 fx_flags
# Manual
press A 3
wait 30
# Jian: Fight, pick, OK
press A 3
wait 30
press A 3
wait 30
press A 3
wait 30
shot sp_lucia_menu
# Lucia: Special
press Right 3
wait 20
press A 3
wait 30
shot sp_list
press A 3
wait 30
shot sp_target
press A 3
wait 30
shot sp_after
press A 3
wait 30
shot sp_after2
press A 3
wait 30
press A 3
wait 30
press A 3
wait 30
